@startuml 08c_seq_review
' Sequence diagram 3 — Review and publish a submission (v0.4, 2026-10-30)
' Changes from v0.3: no lock while reviewing, only an "opened by" warning (decisions.md);
' the suggestion is recalculated in the browser with the same rules code; the decision
' batch starts with a guard so a double decision cancels the whole batch.
!include _seq.iuml
title 3 · Review and publish a submission

actor "Reviewer\n(MOTIVAȚIE)" as R
participant "Review dashboard\n(Next.js pages)" as Dash
box "Backend · Next.js on Cloudflare" #FAFAFA
  participant "Domain services\n+ requireRole()" as Svc
  participant "Rules scoring" as Score
  database "D1" as DB
end box
participant "R2\n(photos)" as R2
participant "Email\nprovider" as Mail

== Open the queue ==
R -> Dash : open review queue
Dash -> Svc : list pending submissions
Svc -> Svc : requireRole(reviewer)
Svc -> DB : PENDING, oldest first
DB --> Svc : rows
Svc --> Dash : queue
Dash --> R : list with suggested levels

== Open one submission ==
R -> Dash : open submission
Dash -> Svc : load(id)
Svc -> Svc : requireRole(reviewer)
Svc -> DB : answers, suggestion + notes,\ncurrent assessment (if any), "opened by"
DB --> Svc : rows
Svc --> Dash : submission + signed photo links
Dash -> R2 : load photos
R2 --> Dash : photos
Dash --> R : answers and photos side by side,\nsuggestion, current vs proposed,\nwarning if opened by someone else recently
Dash -> Svc : markOpened(id)
Svc -> DB : opened by me, now\n(a warning for others, not a lock)

opt reviewer corrects an answer
  R -> Dash : e.g. door width 8 → 80 cm
  Dash -> Dash : recalculate suggestion\n(same rules code as the server)
end

== Decide ==
alt Approve
  R -> Dash : approve
  Dash -> Svc : approve(id, corrections)
  Svc -> Svc : requireRole(reviewer)
  Svc -> Score : recompute from corrected answers
  Score --> Svc : merged answers, publishing rule
  Svc -> Svc : merge with unchanged criteria\nof the current assessment
  Svc -> DB : one batch: submission APPROVED\n(guard: cancels everything if already decided),\ncorrections, old assessment → history,\nnew one → CURRENT,\nplace level + last verified = now, change log
  DB --> Svc : ok
  Svc --> Dash : published / saved
  Dash --> R : done, next in queue
else Reject (reason required)
  R -> Dash : reject + reason
  Dash -> Svc : reject(id, reason)
  Svc -> Svc : requireRole(reviewer)
  Svc -> DB : one batch: submission REJECTED\n+ reason, change log (with the same guard)\n(verified data untouched)
  DB --> Svc : ok
  Svc --> Dash : rejected
end

Svc ->> Mail : after the response:\ndecision email to the contributor\n(not built yet: no email service chosen)

note over Svc, DB
  <b>Publishing rule</b>
  Inaccessible: shown once the entry path is known.
  Accessible / partially accessible: shown once all
  6 mandatory criteria are known. Until then the
  approved answers are saved, but the place stays
  "Not yet rated" in the app.
end note
note over R2 : Photos of rejected submissions\nare deleted after 6 months\n(Cleanup job).
@enduml
